# One line ending everywhere. CI checks out on Linux; a Windows clone with
# core.autocrlf=true otherwise rewrites every text file to CRLF on checkout
# and warns "LF will be replaced by CRLF" on every commit. Text files are
# detected automatically; the binary list below keeps git from ever
# touching a committed plate, scan, or font (npm run check:art verifies
# every plate's sha256 against src/lib/art.lock.json).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.avif binary
*.webp binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff2 binary
